# Steam client for Windows.
# Its own processes draw their Chromium UI through DXVK (D3D11 on Vulkan/MoltenVK) on wine's own
# DXGI; games it starts keep D3DMetal. Environment and helper list from frankea/Whisky's
# LauncherPresets.swift (GPL-3.0-or-later): the overlay is gameoverlayui64.exe in current
# clients, GameOverlayUI.exe in older ones. Chromium probes NVIDIA's libraries, and the ones
# MetalFX needs in system32 pull D3DMetal into the helper, which crashes it: they are off there.
name Steam
kind launcher
status tested
symbol gamecontroller
about Магазин и лаунчер Valve. Интерфейс рисуется через DXVK, игры получают D3DMetal.
about-en Valve's store and launcher. Its window draws through DXVK, games get D3DMetal.
bottle steam
installer https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/client/installer/SteamSetup.exe /S
exe C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\Steam.exe
games steam
env LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8
env LANG=en_US.UTF-8
env LC_TIME=C
env LC_NUMERIC=C
env STEAM_DISABLE_CEF_SANDBOX=1
env CEF_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1
env STEAM_RUNTIME=0
env DXVK_ASYNC=1
dxvk steam.exe
dxvk steamwebhelper.exe
dxvk steamservice.exe
dxvk gameoverlayui64.exe
dxvk GameOverlayUI.exe
dll steamwebhelper.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll steamservice.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll gameoverlayui64.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll GameOverlayUI.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
shutdown -shutdown
